## ⚙️ FINAL SERVER CONFIG (2026 PRODUCTION READY)

```bash id="final_server"
# 🇮🇳 India NTP upstream sources
server time.nplindia.in iburst
server samay1.nic.in iburst
server samay2.nic.in iburst
server time.nplindia.org iburst

# System sync
driftfile /var/lib/chrony/drift
rtcsync
makestep 1.0 3

# 🔐 Security hardening
cmdport 0

# 🧠 Stability controls (IMPORTANT)
maxdistance 3.0
maxdelay 0.8
minsources 2

# 🌐 Allow internal clients only
allow 192.168.1.0/24
```

---

## 🔄 RESTART SERVER

### RHEL

```bash
sudo systemctl restart chronyd
```

### Ubuntu

```bash
sudo systemctl restart chrony
```

---

## 🔍 VERIFY SERVER

```bash
chronyc tracking
chronyc sources -v
```

---

## 🔥 FIREWALL (SERVER ONLY)

### RHEL

```bash
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-service=ntp
sudo firewall-cmd --reload
```

### Ubuntu

```bash
sudo ufw allow 123/udp
```

